[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17101.11, "timestamp": "04:45:01", "text": "为了我的工作，嗯，她也算是打扫了一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17103.67, "timestamp": "04:45:03", "text": "太好了，以至于我无法再找到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17106.55, "timestamp": "04:45:06", "text": "那个蓝牙连接器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17108.788, "timestamp": "04:45:08", "text": "耳机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17110.708, "timestamp": "04:45:10", "text": "所以，我有耳机。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17113.75, "timestamp": "04:45:13", "text": "呃呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17116.708, "timestamp": "04:45:16", "text": "连接电缆，但我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17119.51, "timestamp": "04:45:19", "text": "蓝牙连接器。所以，就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17122.948, "timestamp": "04:45:22", "text": "已无法正常工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17127.27, "timestamp": "04:45:27", "text": "不，哦，不。哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17131.43, "timestamp": "04:45:31", "text": "嗯。我以前经常买这些便宜的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17134.31, "timestamp": "04:45:34", "text": "你在亚马逊上看到的，然后把开销塞进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17136.07, "timestamp": "04:45:36", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17140.868, "timestamp": "04:45:40", "text": "嗯，以前我每次把它放在我的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17144.07, "timestamp": "04:45:44", "text": "头部，并且喜欢长时间使用它，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17147.43, "timestamp": "04:45:47", "text": "比如一个小时或更长时间，我以前经常会遇到这种情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17150.23, "timestamp": "04:45:50", "text": "耳朵以前总是会出汗，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17153.19, "timestamp": "04:45:53", "text": "感觉头以前就像某种……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17156.628, "timestamp": "04:45:56", "text": "感觉很闷，而且慢慢地就会变得很闷。"}]